#: chemotools.adaptation._x_axis_interpolator.XAxisInterpolator:1 of
msgid "Interpolate every row of ``X`` onto a shared ``common_x_axis``."
msgstr "将 ``X`` 的每一行插值到共享的 ``common_x_axis`` 上。"

#: chemotools.adaptation._x_axis_interpolator.XAxisInterpolator:3 of
msgid ""
"The transformer resamples each row of ``X`` from a sample-specific (or "
"shared) input grid ``x_axis`` onto a fixed ``common_x_axis`` provided at "
"instantiation time."
msgstr ""
"此转换器将 ``X`` 的每一行从样本特有（或共享）的输入网格 ``x_axis`` 重采样到实例化时提供的固定 "
"``common_x_axis`` 上。"

#: chemotools.adaptation._x_axis_interpolator.XAxisInterpolator:7 of
msgid ""
"``x_axis`` is consumed as **metadata** so it flows correctly through "
"``Pipeline``, ``ColumnTransformer``, ``GridSearchCV``, ``cross_validate``"
" etc., once metadata routing is enabled via:"
msgstr ""
"``x_axis`` 作为**元数据**使用，因此通过以下方式启用元数据路由后，它可以正确流经 "
"``Pipeline`` 、 ``ColumnTransformer`` 、 ``GridSearchCV`` 、 ``cross_validate`` 等："

#: chemotools.adaptation._x_axis_interpolator.XAxisInterpolator:11 of
msgid "``sklearn.set_config(enable_metadata_routing=True)``."
msgstr "``sklearn.set_config(enable_metadata_routing=True)``。"

#: ../../source/methods/generated/chemotools.adaptation.XAxisInterpolator.rst
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "参数"

#: chemotools.adaptation._x_axis_interpolator.XAxisInterpolator:13 of
msgid ""
"Strictly increasing target grid. ``transform`` returns an array with "
"``n_output_features`` columns."
msgstr ""
"严格递增的目标网格。``transform`` 返回包含 ``n_output_features`` 列的数组。"

#: chemotools.adaptation._x_axis_interpolator.XAxisInterpolator:16 of
msgid ""
"The interpolation mode. One of: ``\"linear\"``, ``\"cubic\"`` or "
"``\"pchip\"``."
msgstr ""
"插值模式。可选值为 ``\"linear\"``、``\"cubic\"`` 或 ``\"pchip\"``。"

#: chemotools.adaptation._x_axis_interpolator.XAxisInterpolator:19 of
msgid ""
"Value returned for query points below the input grid (passed to "
":func:`numpy.interp`)."
msgstr ""
"查询点低于输入网格时返回的值（传给 :func:`numpy.interp`）。"

#: chemotools.adaptation._x_axis_interpolator.XAxisInterpolator:22 of
msgid "Value returned for query points above the input grid."
msgstr "查询点高于输入网格时返回的值。"

#: chemotools.adaptation._x_axis_interpolator.XAxisInterpolator:24 of
msgid ""
"Number of parallel jobs used to process sample rows independently during "
":meth:`transform`. Use ``1`` for serial execution."
msgstr ""
"在 :meth:`transform` 期间用于独立处理样本行的并行作业数。使用 ``1`` 进行串行执行。"

#: ../../source/methods/generated/chemotools.adaptation.XAxisInterpolator.rst
msgid "Variables"
msgstr "变量"

#: chemotools.adaptation._x_axis_interpolator.XAxisInterpolator:28 of
msgid "Validated copy of ``common_x_axis``."
msgstr "``common_x_axis`` 经过验证的副本。"

#: chemotools.adaptation._x_axis_interpolator.XAxisInterpolator:31 of
msgid "Number of input features seen during ``fit``."
msgstr "在 ``fit`` 期间看到的输入特征数。"

#: chemotools.adaptation._x_axis_interpolator.XAxisInterpolator:34 of
msgid "Names of features seen during ``fit`` (only if ``X`` had names)."
msgstr "在 ``fit`` 期间看到的特征名称（仅当 ``X`` 具有名称时）。"

