msgid "Return type"
msgstr "返回类型"

#: chemotools.adaptation._x_axis_interpolator.XAxisInterpolator.transform:1 of
msgid "Interpolate ``X`` from ``x_axis`` onto ``common_x_axis_``."
msgstr "将 ``X`` 从 ``x_axis`` 插值到 ``common_x_axis_`` 上。"

#: chemotools.adaptation._x_axis_interpolator.XAxisInterpolator.transform:3 of
msgid ""
"``x_axis`` is **metadata** and must be requested explicitly via "
"``set_transform_request(x_axis=True)`` for routing to work in a "
"``Pipeline`` / ``GridSearchCV``."
msgstr ""
"``x_axis`` 是**元数据**，必须通过 ``set_transform_request(x_axis=True)`` 显式请求，"
"路由才能在 ``Pipeline`` / ``GridSearchCV`` 中工作。"

#: chemotools.adaptation._x_axis_interpolator.XAxisInterpolator.transform:7 of
msgid "Signal values sampled on ``x_axis``."
msgstr "在 ``x_axis`` 上采样的信号值。"

#: chemotools.adaptation._x_axis_interpolator.XAxisInterpolator.transform:9 of
msgid ""
"Either shape ``(n_features,)`` (shared grid for every row) or "
"``(n_samples, n_features)`` (per-row grid). Must be strictly increasing "
"along the feature axis."
msgstr ""
"形状为 ``(n_features,)`` （每行共享网格）或 ``(n_samples, n_features)`` （逐行网格）。"
"沿特征轴必须严格递增。"

#: chemotools.adaptation._x_axis_interpolator.XAxisInterpolator.transform:14 of
msgid "**X_transformed**"
msgstr "**X_transformed**"

#: chemotools.adaptation._x_axis_interpolator.XAxisInterpolator.fit_transform:1
#: of
msgid "Fit to data, then transform it."
msgstr "拟合数据，然后进行转换。"

#: chemotools.adaptation._x_axis_interpolator.XAxisInterpolator.fit_transform:3
#: of
msgid ""
"``fit`` does not consume ``x_axis``; only ``transform`` does. This custom"
" implementation ensures ``x_axis`` is forwarded only to ``transform``, "
"not to ``fit``."
msgstr ""
"``fit`` 不使用 ``x_axis``，仅 ``transform`` 使用。此自定义实现确保 ``x_axis`` 只转发给 ``transform``，"
"而不转发给 ``fit``。"

#: chemotools.adaptation._x_axis_interpolator.XAxisInterpolator.fit_transform:11
#: of
msgid "Input grid for interpolation, forwarded to ``transform``."
msgstr "用于插值并转发给 ``transform`` 的输入网格。"

#: chemotools.adaptation._x_axis_interpolator.XAxisInterpolator.fit_transform:14
#: of
msgid "**X_new**"
msgstr "**X_new**"

#: chemotools.adaptation._x_axis_interpolator.XAxisInterpolator.get_feature_names_out:1
#: of
msgid "Names are the positions of the common grid."
msgstr "名称为公共网格的位置。"

#: of sklearn.utils._metadata_requests.RequestMethod.__get__.<locals>.func:1
msgid ""
"Configure whether metadata should be requested to be passed to the "
"``fit`` method."
msgstr ""
"配置是否请求将元数据传递给 ``fit`` 方法。"

#: of sklearn.utils._metadata_requests.RequestMethod.__get__.<locals>.func:3
msgid ""
"Note that this method is only relevant when this estimator is used as a "
"sub-estimator within a :term:`meta-estimator` and metadata routing is "
"enabled with ``enable_metadata_routing=True`` (see "
":func:`sklearn.set_config`). Please check the :ref:`User Guide "
"<metadata_routing>` on how the routing mechanism works."
msgstr ""
"请注意，仅当此估计器用作 :term:`meta-estimator` 中的子估计器，并通过 "
"``enable_metadata_routing=True`` 启用元数据路由时，此方法才有意义（参见 "
":func:`sklearn.set_config`）。有关路由机制的工作方式，请查阅 :ref:`用户指南 <metadata_routing>`。"

#: of sklearn.utils._metadata_requests.RequestMethod.__get__.<locals>.func:9
msgid "The options for each parameter are:"
msgstr "每个参数可使用以下选项："

#: of sklearn.utils._metadata_requests.RequestMethod.__get__.<locals>.func:11
msgid ""
"``True``: metadata is requested, and passed to ``fit`` if provided. The "
"request is ignored if metadata is not provided."
msgstr ""
"``True``：请求元数据；若已提供，则将其传给 ``fit``。若未提供元数据，则忽略该请求。"

#: of sklearn.utils._metadata_requests.RequestMethod.__get__.<locals>.func:13
msgid ""
"``False``: metadata is not requested and the meta-estimator will not pass"
" it to ``fit``."
msgstr ""
"``False``：不请求元数据，元估计器不会将其传给 ``fit``。"

#: of sklearn.utils._metadata_requests.RequestMethod.__get__.<locals>.func:15
msgid ""
"``None``: metadata is not requested, and the meta-estimator will raise an"
" error if the user provides it."
msgstr ""
"``None``：不请求元数据；若用户提供元数据，元估计器将引发错误。"

#: of sklearn.utils._metadata_requests.RequestMethod.__get__.<locals>.func:17
msgid ""
"``str``: metadata should be passed to the meta-estimator with this given "
"alias instead of the original name."
msgstr ""
"``str``：元数据应使用给定别名而非原始名称传给元估计器。"

#: of sklearn.utils._metadata_requests.RequestMethod.__get__.<locals>.func:19
msgid ""
"The default (``sklearn.utils.metadata_routing.UNCHANGED``) retains the "
"existing request. This allows you to change the request for some "
"parameters and not others."
msgstr ""
"默认值（``sklearn.utils.metadata_routing.UNCHANGED``）会保留现有请求。这样可以只更改部分参数的请求，"
"而不更改其他参数。"

#: of sklearn.utils._metadata_requests.RequestMethod.__get__.<locals>.func:25
msgid "Metadata routing for ``x_axis`` parameter in ``fit``."
msgstr "``fit`` 中 ``x_axis`` 参数的元数据路由。"

#: of sklearn.utils._metadata_requests.RequestMethod.__get__.<locals>.func:28
msgid "**self** -- The updated object."
msgstr "**self** -- 更新后的对象。"

#: of sklearn.utils._metadata_requests.RequestMethod.__get__.<locals>.func:1
msgid ""
"Configure whether metadata should be requested to be passed to the "
"``transform`` method."
msgstr ""
"配置是否请求将元数据传递给 ``transform`` 方法。"

#: of sklearn.utils._metadata_requests.RequestMethod.__get__.<locals>.func:11
msgid ""
"``True``: metadata is requested, and passed to ``transform`` if provided."
" The request is ignored if metadata is not provided."
msgstr ""
"``True``：请求元数据；若已提供，则将其传给 ``transform``。若未提供元数据，则忽略该请求。"

#: of sklearn.utils._metadata_requests.RequestMethod.__get__.<locals>.func:13
msgid ""
"``False``: metadata is not requested and the meta-estimator will not pass"
" it to ``transform``."
msgstr ""
"``False``：不请求元数据，元估计器不会将其传给 ``transform``。"

#: of sklearn.utils._metadata_requests.RequestMethod.__get__.<locals>.func:25
msgid "Metadata routing for ``x_axis`` parameter in ``transform``."
msgstr "``transform`` 中 ``x_axis`` 参数的元数据路由。"

